      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاطَرْتُهُ مَالِى</span></b>  <i>I halved with him my property;</i>
(S, K;) <i>I retained half of my property and gave
him the other half.</i> (M, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاطَرْتُ</span>

<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَلِيِّى</span> <i>I left for my lamb,</i> or <i>kid, one teat</i> [<i>of the
mother</i>], <i>having milked the other teat and bound
it with the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِرَار</span> [q. v.]. (S.)

